      "llm_score": 2,
      "corrected_score": 3,
      "comment": "Override to 3. The judge itself says \"The specificity itself is sound\": one named person, one place, one unknown (when he arrived). The judge notes mark specificity down for more than one unknown (\"When and from where…\"), which this isn't. Patrick versus the family is the same point as under Correctness, and the notes don't require \"family\" wording."
